                        <h2 id="teams-heading" class="mt-4 text-[2rem] font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[2.15rem] dark:text-white">Work alone or <span class="text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">as a team</span></h2>

                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600 sm:text-[15px] dark:text-gray-300">Sign up and you get your own workspace. Create an organization for your team, invite people by email and give each one a role.</p>

                        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600 sm:text-[15px] dark:text-gray-300">Each organization keeps its own data, separate from every other organization's. Belong to several organizations and switch between them in one click.</p>
